Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the eagles beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.97,0:00:03.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,11 inflatable tube men?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:03.66,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.66,0:00:05.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,have saquon barkley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.18,0:00:05.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:07.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,are full of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:07.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,this should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.55,0:00:08.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,the easiest win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.49,0:00:09.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,except, the eagles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.56,0:00:11.79,Cap,,0,0,0,,have lost six straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.79,0:00:13.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,games, their first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:15.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,six-game skid since 2012.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:16.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,kickoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.09,0:00:16.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,up 10 to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.07,0:00:18.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,then they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.80,0:00:20.39,Cap,,0,0,0,,never score again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.39,0:00:21.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,saquon runs straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,into a tube man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:23.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,it flops over and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:24.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,pops right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.90,0:00:26.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,two yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.41,0:00:27.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,tanner mckee drops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:29.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,five tube men flail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,at him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.11,0:00:30.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,sacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:33.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,jake elliott lines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,up a field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.67,0:00:35.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:36.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,off the upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:37.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.29,0:00:39.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,score 27 straight points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score: tube
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.03,0:00:43.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,men 27, eagles 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:44.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,one tube man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:45.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,kicked four field
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.27,0:00:46.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,goals and outscored
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.30,0:00:48.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.15,0:00:49.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,next week, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.01,0:00:50.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,eagles host the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:51.18,Cap,,0,0,0,,the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,are still waving.
